From 63beeab2fc2d03039cd1adbbbf8251605af3be40 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mike Kinney <2219838+mkinney@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 14:42:00 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] refactor(app): split operation/params.rs below the 400-line
 law

OpParams::stamp_with was one ~1780-line function. Its arms move, verbatim,
into child modules of params by operation family (mill2d, mill3d,
multiaxis, turning, holes, cutting); the shared writers and the link
trailer move to params/digest.rs. The dispatch in params.rs stays
exhaustive and keeps the pocket family inline, so open PRs #1817 and
#2037 (Pocket arm) merge clean. No digest byte changes.

Pinned by params_files_stay_under_the_line_law.

Fixes #1849

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
